<title>USA: PHLX to list options on Teleport.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list options on Teleport.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said on Friday that it would list options on Teleport Communications Group Inc on October 4.</p>
<p>The options will have opening strike prices of 22-1/2, 25 and 30. Initial expiration months will be October, November, January and April. Teleport shares ended at 24-1/8 Friday.</p>
<p>The PHLX said TFM Investment Group will be the specialist.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
